      ("p", "At the workshop we read the [[centralita|control unit]] of the affected system using [[diagnosis-obd|OBD diagnostics]] and, from the code, check physically what's happening. An [[abs|ABS]] light, for example, can be a dirty wheel sensor, a damaged wire or a fault in the hydraulic unit. They're not the same, and they don't cost the same."),
