      ("h2", "Warning lights and the ITV"),
      ("p", "Driving with the airbag, ABS or engine light on can count as a defect at the [[itv|ITV (MOT)]]. If your inspection is coming up, see our [pre-ITV check](servicio-pre-itv.html). And if you're not sure whether to move the car, [get in touch](contacto.html) before starting it."),
