      ("doc", "Estimate and approval", "You know when the estimate is ready and, if it's an insurance job, where the assessment is up to."),
      ("wrench", "Repair in progress", "We let you know what stage the work is at."),
      ("alert", "Unexpected findings", "If something new turns up during dismantling, we tell you before carrying on."),
      ("check", "Ready to go", "We let you know as soon as the car is finished and ready to collect or be delivered."),
