      ("p", "Keeping you informed also helps you decide in time. If a part is taking longer than expected, you can consider asking for a [courtesy car](servicio-vehiculo-de-sustitucion.html) or rearranging your plans. And if anything isn't clear at any point, ask us: we'd rather explain twice than leave you unsure."),
