      ("tool", "Parts and labour", "A breakdown of parts and expected labour time."),
      ("calendar", "Validity", "How long the estimate is valid for."),
      ("clock", "Expected turnaround", "An approximate repair time, which also depends on parts arriving."),
      ("chat", "Explained in person", "If you like, we'll go through it point by point by phone or at the workshop."),
